%%% note
由来: https://docs.mulesoft.com/dataweave/2.11/dw-core-functions-plusplus (関数ページ)
doc と相違 (doc の Output と実 DW の出力の値が一致しない)
doc の Output:
  { "LocalDateTime": "2017-10-01T23:57:59" }
%%% script
%dw 2.0
output application/json
---
{ "LocalDateTime" : (|23:57:59| ++ |2003-10-01|) }
%%% output application/json
{
  "LocalDateTime": "2003-10-01T23:57:59"
}
